<title>USA: All American to buyback shares.</title>
<headline>All American to buyback shares.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>All American Communications Inc said Thursday its board had approved a plan to repurchase up to one million common shares.</p>
<p>The company said it has outstanding about 5.9 million shares of common, as well as about 5.7 million class B shares and about $46 million principal amount of 6-1/2 percent convertible subordinated notes.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
